OL,3,AUK says Brexit reset deal 'done' but
OL,4,Atalks to continue in some areas after
OL,5,AEU tuition fees demand
OL,6,
OL,7,FHowever, the EU is demanding the UK
OL,8,Fagree to cut university tuition fees
OL,9,Ffor European students, with Britain
OL,10,Fgiven six months to agree or negotiate
OL,11,Fan alternative. The UK has said "talks
OL,12,Fwill continue in some areas", with more
OL,13,Fdetail to be set out later
OL,15,FThe youth mobility scheme is expected
OL,16,Fto allow 100,000 young people from the
OL,17,FEU to travel, work and study in the UK
OL,18,Fper year - the same number of young
OL,19,FBritons would be allowed into Europe
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,108,105,200,300,0,100
